---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — HighJack"
  description="Why HighJack exists: a configurable, deterministic, multiplayer board game built in the open."
>
  <header class="max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="m-0 font-display text-3xl font-extrabold sm:text-4xl">About HighJack</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 mb-0 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-400">
      Most property-board games come with one fixed rulebook. HighJack lets the table choose its
      own rules before the first roll.
    </p>
  </header>

  <section class="mt-12 max-w-3xl" aria-label="Project story">
    <div class="space-y-4 text-md leading-relaxed text-muted-400">
      <p>
        The name is a nod to hitting the jackpot and taking it from someone else. It is play money
        only. The game is about making calculated risks with people you know.
      </p>
      <p>
        The current release is one table: dice, property, rent, tax and bankruptcy. The engine
        decides every outcome on the server from a seeded stream, so the same actions always lead
        to the same match. That makes results checkable and keeps the browser honest.
      </p>
      <p class="mb-0">
        Further systems are designed but not playable yet. Each one is marked with its status on the
        <a class="text-gold-400 no-underline hover:text-gold-500" href="/features">features page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-12" aria-labelledby="stack-title">
    <h2 id="stack-title" class="m-0 font-display text-2xl font-extrabold">Built with</h2>
    <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <article class="rounded-lg border border-line-subtle bg-surface-raised p-5 shadow-card">
        <h3 class="m-0 font-display font-bold text-cream-100">Astro and SolidJS</h3>
        <p class="mb-0 mt-1 text-sm text-muted-400">
          The website is static HTML. The game client is a Solid app.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="rounded-lg border border-line-subtle bg-surface-raised p-5 shadow-card">
        <h3 class="m-0 font-display font-bold text-cream-100">PixiJS</h3>
        <p class="mb-0 mt-1 text-sm text-muted-400">The board is drawn on a canvas.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="rounded-lg border border-line-subtle bg-surface-raised p-5 shadow-card">
        <h3 class="m-0 font-display font-bold text-cream-100">Go</h3>
        <p class="mb-0 mt-1 text-sm text-muted-400">
          The rules engine and the WebSocket server run in one process.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="rounded-lg border border-line-subtle bg-surface-raised p-5 shadow-card">
        <h3 class="m-0 font-display font-bold text-cream-100">Bun</h3>
        <p class="mb-0 mt-1 text-sm text-muted-400">
          One toolchain for the workspaces, tests and builds.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section
    class="mt-12 max-w-3xl rounded-lg border border-line-subtle bg-felt-900/60 p-6"
    aria-label="Open source"
  >
    <h2 class="m-0 font-display text-lg font-bold text-cream-100">Open source</h2>
    <p class="mb-0 mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-400">
      The engine, protocol, tooling and this site are MIT-licensed at
      <a
        href="https://github.com/analeis/highjack"
        class="font-bold text-gold-400 hover:text-gold-500"
      >
        github.com/analeis/highjack
      </a>
      . The architecture notes and audit history are in the repository.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
